            "value": "Skip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "„Deine Konzertwoche“ kommt jeden Donnerstag: persönlich ausgewählte Konzerte der nächsten Tage in deiner Stadt, nach deinen gefolgten Künstler:innen, Ensembles und Orten, deiner Merkliste, deinen Lieblingsgenres und dem, was deine Freunde vorhaben. Jede E-Mail enthält einen Link zum Abmelden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Your Concert Week” arrives every Thursday: concerts for the coming days in your city, picked for you based on the artists, ensembles and venues you follow, your saved list, your favourite genres and your friends' plans. Every email includes an unsubscribe link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "„Wie war's?“ am Tag danach": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“How was it?” the day after"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• E-Mail-Adresse, Passwort-Hash: Konto/Login": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Email address, password hash: account/login"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Interessen/Präferenzen: personalisierte Empfehlungen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Interests/preferences: personalized recommendations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Push-Token: Benachrichtigungen zu Konzerten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Push token: concert notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Standortdaten (bei Erlaubnis): Kartenansicht, Standort-Check-in bei Konzertbesuchen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Location data (with permission): map view, location check-in at concerts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Suchhistorie (eingeloggt): persönliche Empfehlungen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Search history (signed in): personal recommendations"
          }
        }
      }
    }
